{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 93,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.974609375,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "The objective of the review was to summarize current economic evidence and further",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        524.4096069335938,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "understand the costs, cost–effectiveness and affordability of low complexity automated NAATs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.960729598999023,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.66522979736328,
        526.9678344726562,
        121.81022644042969
      ],
      "text": "Two low complexity automated NAATs were identified: the MeltPro MTB/RIF (Xiamen Zeesan",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.16522979736328,
        526.6399536132812,
        137.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "Biotech Co Ltd, China) and the Xpert MTB/XDR assay (Cepheid, Sunnyvale, USA). Only data",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        526.9656372070312,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "concerning Xpert MTB/XDR are included in this review. As is the case with Xpert MTB/RIF, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        527.05908203125,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "novel XDR assay can be used to test either unprocessed or concentrated sputum. No published",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98333740234375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.66522216796875,
        526.789794921875,
        183.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "studies providing direct evidence on the cost or cost–effectiveness of low complexity automated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94651985168457,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.16522216796875,
        183.74729919433594,
        199.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "NAATs were identified.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.16912841796875,
        526.8199462890625,
        223.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "Through direct communication from the Xpert MTB/XDR manufacturer, Cepheid, the low- and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977426528930664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.66912841796875,
        526.9151611328125,
        238.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "middle-income country (LMIC) cost for the XDR cartridge is expected to be US$ 19.80 ex-works.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970510482788086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.16912841796875,
        526.9149780273438,
        254.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "Shipping and customs costs will be additional and will be borne by the ordering nations or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.66912841796875,
        445.344482421875,
        269.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "organizations, as is currently the case for Xpert MTB/RIF and Ultra cartridges.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.17303466796875,
        526.6984252929688,
        292.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "As with the Xpert MTB/RIF and Ultra assays, the test cartridge costs represent just one component",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        293.17303466796875,
        526.9700317382812,
        306.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "of the total unit test costs that must be considered, with equipment being another important",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        307.17303466796875,
        526.9801635742188,
        320.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "consideration. The Xpert MTB/XDR test will not work on existing six-colour modules and will",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.1730041503906,
        527.1990966796875,
        334.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "require laboratories to upgrade to 10-colour GeneXpert modules. There will be different",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1730041503906,
        527.1488037109375,
        348.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "upgrade options for the 10-colour system, with different price points depending on the needs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998350143432617,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.1730041503906,
        314.3697509765625,
        362.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "and resources available. Upgrade options include:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        368.9250183105469,
        78.81909942626953,
        382.0700378417969
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        368.9250183105469,
        526.9928588867188,
        382.0700378417969
      ],
      "text": "a new 10-colour system – this is the most costly option, at US$ 9420 for one module to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        384.4250183105469,
        507.9827880859375,
        397.5700378417969
      ],
      "text": "US$ 72 350 for 16 modules, including the GeneXpert platform, computer and scanner;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        399.9250183105469,
        78.81909942626953,
        413.0700378417969
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        399.9250183105469,
        526.980224609375,
        413.0700378417969
      ],
      "text": "a new 10-colour satellite instrument with the GeneXpert connected to an existing system –",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.999650001525879,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        415.4250183105469,
        457.64215087890625,
        428.5700378417969
      ],
      "text": "this costs from US$ 6495 for one module to US$ 69 525 for 16 modules; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        430.9250183105469,
        78.81909942626953,
        444.0700378417969
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        430.9250183105469,
        526.85302734375,
        444.0700378417969
      ],
      "text": "converting an existing GeneXpert system from a six-colour to a 10-colour system by replacing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946017265319824,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        446.4250183105469,
        328.5572509765625,
        459.5700378417969
      ],
      "text": "modules – a 10-colour module kit costs US$ 3860.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        473.2635192871094,
        526.9487915039062,
        486.4085388183594
      ],
      "text": "Additional cost considerations for Xpert MTB/XDR include additional testing or repeated testing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.7635192871094,
        526.7828979492188,
        501.9085388183594
      ],
      "text": "in the case of indeterminate or non-actionable results (indeterminate, non-determinate or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.2635498046875,
        527.0689697265625,
        517.4085693359375
      ],
      "text": "invalid). The potential cost burden of this is likely to vary, depending on the proportion of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.7635498046875,
        465.8588562011719,
        532.9085693359375
      ],
      "text": "indeterminate test results across settings and the associated re-testing protocols.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.7675170898438,
        526.964599609375,
        556.9125366210938
      ],
      "text": "No studies that have directly assessed the cost–effectiveness of the Xpert MTB/XDR cartridge",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.2675170898438,
        526.823974609375,
        572.4125366210938
      ],
      "text": "were identified. Although extrapolation from other platforms and testing approaches for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        574.7675170898438,
        527.0211791992188,
        587.9125366210938
      ],
      "text": "costing may be appropriate, extrapolation of cost–effectiveness data from Xpert MTB/RIF (Ultra)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        590.2675170898438,
        526.9668579101562,
        603.4125366210938
      ],
      "text": "or other NAATs is not advised because of differences in diagnostic accuracy, costs associated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.7675170898438,
        447.65399169921875,
        618.9125366210938
      ],
      "text": "with XDR treatment, and the different testing and treatment cascade of care.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.7714233398438,
        526.9656372070312,
        642.9164428710938
      ],
      "text": "Several factors are likely to influence the cost–effectiveness of Xpert MTB/XDR; they include",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.2714233398438,
        527.0029907226562,
        658.4164428710938
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic accuracy, which may lead to more or fewer individuals being diagnosed compared",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        660.7714233398438,
        527.035888671875,
        673.9164428710938
      ],
      "text": "with the standard of care (which in turn will vary, depending on the local standard of care). In",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.2714233398438,
        526.9810180664062,
        689.4164428710938
      ],
      "text": "addition to diagnostic accuracy associated with the test itself, the diagnostic algorithm and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        691.7714233398438,
        496.4825134277344,
        704.9164428710938
      ],
      "text": "placement of the Xpert MTB/XDR test within the algorithm has important implications.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.775390625,
        527.28759765625,
        728.92041015625
      ],
      "text": "The novel Xpert MTB/XDR provides results in less than 90 minutes. Thus, introduction of this test",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99679946899414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.275390625,
        527.142822265625,
        744.42041015625
      ],
      "text": "is likely to result in faster time to a result for genotypic DST and could affect cost–effectiveness by",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990546226501465,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        746.775390625,
        527.0466918945312,
        759.92041015625
      ],
      "text": "improving the numbers of patients initiating treatment, reducing loss to follow-up and improving",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.960027694702148,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        762.275390625,
        526.93701171875,
        775.42041015625
      ],
      "text": "survival rates. Costs associated with XDR treatment are likely to be an important driver of cost",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 77",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}